@startuml
' The sequence skinparams of PlantUML's guide: an answer's words under
' its arrow (one written with its head on the left), words wrapped at a
' width, stereotypes in `<<` `>>` under the names, solid lifelines.
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 80
skinparam guillemet false
skinparam stereotypePosition bottom
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
participant Client << browser >>
participant Server << service >>
Client -> Server : a question long enough to wrap
Client <-- Server : the answer, written back, under its arrow
@enduml
